 "name": "S14: Ch5, High performers, steady middle, low performers",
 "text_content": "Pages 419 to 448. Chapter 5: Managing high performers, The steady middle, Managing low performers.\n\nS\u014fn output (draft): performance management playbooks, three tiers.\n\nThe steady middle is the one that matters most here. A restaurant is carried by its steady middle. Her chapter gives it one page out of thirty. That imbalance is a tech-company artifact, where the top decile drives outsize output. It does not hold on a floor where consistency is the product. Weight the translation accordingly and say why.",
 "description": "Pages 419 to 448. Chapter 5: Managing high performers, The steady middle, Managing low performers.\n\nS\u014fn output (draft): performance management playbooks, three tiers.\n\nThe steady middle is the one that matters most here. A restaurant is carried by its steady middle. Her chapter gives it one page out of thirty. That imbalance is a tech-company artifact, where the top decile drives outsize output. It does not hold on a floor where consistency is the product. Weight the translation accordingly and say why.",
